<!doctype lake><title>🕵️ 𝓟𝓸𝓼𝓲𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="liAgs" id="liAgs" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uc6bfd297" id="uc6bfd297">🐦‍⬛</span><span data-lake-id="ube6633ab" id="ube6633ab"> 𝐘𝐚𝐑𝐍: 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐱𝐭 𝐖𝐢𝐧𝐝𝐨𝐰 𝐄𝐱𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐨𝐟 𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐞 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ue21448e5" id="ue21448e5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6ae7de99" id="u6ae7de99">在执行 NLP 任务时，由训练过程决定的最大序列长度，即上下文窗口，构成预训练大语言模型的主要限制之一。因此，通过少量微调，甚至无需微调，动态扩展上下文窗口的需求日益迫切。围绕这一目标，Transformer 的位置编码成为研究讨论的核心</span></strong></p><ul list="ua03c65ca"><li fid="u24b23367" data-lake-id="ubec1a51c" id="ubec1a51c"><span data-lake-id="u871ad671" id="u871ad671">最初的 Transformer 架构采用绝对正弦位置编码，随后改进为可学习的绝对位置编码。此后，相对位置编码方案进一步提升 Transformer 的性能</span></li><li fid="u24b23367" data-lake-id="u20428a26" id="u20428a26"><span data-lake-id="u15287be4" id="u15287be4">目前，最常用的相对位置编码包括 T5 相对偏置、RoPE、XPos 和 ALiBi</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9d7835a1" id="u9d7835a1"><strong><span data-lake-id="udee1fd56" id="udee1fd56">位置编码普遍存在的一项局限是，难以泛化到超出训练阶段所见上下文窗口的序列。尽管 ALiBi 等方法能够实现有限程度的泛化，但尚无方法能够泛化至显著超过预训练长度的序列</span></strong></p><ul list="u4815e1fd"><li fid="u595ddb6f" data-lake-id="u62016a4d" id="u62016a4d"><span data-lake-id="u558b72b7" id="u558b72b7">Chen et al. 与同期的 kaiokendev 提出，通过位置插值对 RoPE 进行轻微修改，并结合少量数据微调来扩展上下文长度</span></li><li fid="u595ddb6f" data-lake-id="ue47d94b1" id="ue47d94b1"><span data-lake-id="ua4b72847" id="ua4b72847">作为另一种方案，bloc97 考虑高频信息的损失，提出 NTK-aware 插值。此后，研究者又提出两种各有侧重的 NTK-aware 插值改进方法</span></li></ul><ul list="u4815e1fd" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u595ddb6f" data-lake-id="u885b93f6" id="u885b93f6"><span data-lake-id="u56f270db" id="u56f270db">Dynamic NTK 插值方法，面向未经微调的预训练模型</span></li><li fid="u595ddb6f" data-lake-id="u81d47eac" id="u81d47eac"><span data-lake-id="u9a7b134b" id="u9a7b134b">NTK-by-parts 插值方法，在使用少量更长上下文数据进行微调时表现最佳</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf3b1cc8e" id="uf3b1cc8e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5db690b8" id="u5db690b8" style="color: #270070">本文提出 YaRN。这是一种改进的上下文窗口扩展方法，能够高效扩展采用旋转位置编码训练的模型的上下文窗口，在使用不足原始预训练数据量约 0.1% 的数据进行微调后，YaRN 即可在上下文窗口扩展方面达到最先进的性能。同时，通过结合称为动态缩放的推理阶段技术，Dynamic-YaRN 能够在完全无需微调的情况下，将上下文窗口扩展至原来的 2 倍以上</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="xu3Wf" id="xu3Wf" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u02052497" id="u02052497">🍄</span><span data-lake-id="u3c57748a" id="u3c57748a"> 𝐁𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐝 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐑𝐞𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uafc1ba2c" id="uafc1ba2c"><strong><span data-lake-id="udbe24004" id="udbe24004">以旋转位置编码为基础。考虑一个隐藏层，用</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F558270b7f0a90c3c286b860273d106a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22foPiL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u25a32d73" id="u25a32d73">表示该层隐藏神经元的集合。给定向量序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_L%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B%7CD%7C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1e2c75aafe7b03e94ae52e4453fe5d71.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z6klZ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc716a0ff" id="uc716a0ff">，注意力层首先将这些向量转换为查询向量和键向量</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u935fc6c7" id="u935fc6c7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m%3Df_q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%2Cm)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B%7CD%7C%7D%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n%3Df_k(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n%2Cn)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B%7CD%7C%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F510591e711acfe466ab3e90fbf56cc7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qo5uw%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u204d4ed0" id="u204d4ed0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsoftmax%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m%5E%7BT%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%7CD%7C%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc590257e8f02dd89835314fdbe8885d6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uAZhh%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u0fabf3c6"><li fid="u05112893" data-lake-id="u528afa1f" id="u528afa1f"><span data-lake-id="uef067036" id="uef067036">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d911300b5aa9ba64ea87dc37e49c5b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bkequ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8388357f" id="u8388357f">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d7bc143fde06a7a6505ce4e49d940f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mrko8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc177ee70" id="uc177ee70">均视为列向量，因此</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m%5E%7BT%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff4e7a2e8ee435045b137259e72a3ce92.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22af2pT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4d42fcf" id="ud4d42fcf">就是欧几里得内积。在 RoPE 中，首先假设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%7CD%7C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0de50ddabe7a394809d122bd13c82b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lIM53%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1ec6ed2" id="ua1ec6ed2">为偶数，并通过如下对应关系，将嵌入空间及隐藏状态表示为复向量空间：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B%7CD%7C%7D%5C%5Ccong%5C%5Cmathbb%7BC%7D%5E%7B%7CD%7C%2F2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F634e3f9882b376769e79d4dcabe3960a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X0eRZ%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u05112893" data-lake-id="u4cfa2810" id="u4cfa2810"><span data-lake-id="u8b4e60db" id="u8b4e60db">此时，内积</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D%5E%7BT%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffda0fae4d383fa1566fc2c1282288fd6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wcpB7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uabf60646" id="uabf60646">对应于标准厄米内积的实部</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRe%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D%5E%7B*%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd1dc4f979262a741f51fa7011b7da695.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wq6ii%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u54e869bf" id="u54e869bf">。更具体地，上述同构将交错排列的实部与虚部组合为复数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u671923dc" id="u671923dc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbig((%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m)_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m)_%7B%7CD%7C%7D%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5Cmapsto%5C%5Cbig((%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m)_1%2Bi(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m)_2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C((%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m)_%7B%7CD%7C-1%7D%2Bi(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m)_%7B%7CD%7C%7D)%5C%5Cbig)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7966d1335b1a6e19651d44639c8496ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rmFaW%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6685af41" id="u6685af41" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbig((%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_m)_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_m)_%7B%7CD%7C%7D%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5Cmapsto%5C%5Cbig((%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_m)_1%2Bi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_m)_2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C((%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_m)_%7B%7CD%7C-1%7D%2Bi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_m)_%7B%7CD%7C%7D)%5C%5Cbig).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbe89731edfca1496052dea1eadb39822.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PKPoA%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uebda1a5d" id="uebda1a5d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9c8aee63" id="u9c8aee63">为将嵌入 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc24b44d601b4c709a58f1c27c994e725.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aYccz%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ba7ea42" id="u5ba7ea42">、</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc81eaa7cb5cfac1a7c0b2f5f7b765a3e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aHo6B%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0e5c2132" id="u0e5c2132"> 转换为查询向量和键向量，首先给定如下 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F783edc9638216c947a332014f0ef4d71.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mDfSV%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0a4c62c3" id="u0a4c62c3">-线性算子：</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_q%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_k%3A%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B%7CD%7C%7D%5C%5Crightarrow%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B%7CD%7C%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2850e470f73b333f654343f31f070f60.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XC8Fh%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua4b08817" id="ua4b08817">令</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Ctheta_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%7CD%7C%2F2%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93026505a06966c45b10d51726426b55.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ePV9V%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u69fd8f24" id="u69fd8f24">。在复数坐标下，对于任意线性算子</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd9d83fca25afe01bf94767dca412f738.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22msdlO%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u684bb030" id="u684bb030">，定义</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc4405d9d" id="uc4405d9d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%2Cm%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D)%3De%5E%7Bim%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F89f94e2a4ea9f546dfbd3f01e8d0d560.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kBhWT%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud0c6b929"><li fid="uc1faf21c" data-lake-id="u0dddda8d" id="u0dddda8d"><span data-lake-id="u2df65634" id="u2df65634">RoPE 中的函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54ab9a8b7bb7c1737a740b9386b1f9ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n5oD7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce155b0a" id="uce155b0a">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F25abb1c585b24591b78e8864aad7dd6a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jTj0G%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uffd66303" id="uffd66303">则由下式给出</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3b1c4863" id="u3b1c4863" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_q%3Df_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_q%7D%2C%5C%5Cquad%20f_k%3Df_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_k%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdcfea8513ddbddc56377bb70226ed415.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pU2xH%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uce876c40"><li fid="u0ebb8233" data-lake-id="u9a366853" id="u9a366853"><span data-lake-id="u16220926" id="u16220926">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta_d%3Db%5E%7B-2d%2F%7CD%7C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c7086baff9b91c6a82b309cdd3154eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wj9Rq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u478d4357" id="u478d4357">，且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%3D10000%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb32df133ac43f2ec2c8490569050e752.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nek7J%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u621538c6" id="u621538c6">。通过这种方式，RoPE 为每个复值隐藏神经元关联一个独立的频率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd0c960e191ee9786f8d0ae69f7c99bab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lafEv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2e55d0a3" id="u2e55d0a3">。这样做的优点在于，查询向量与键向量的点积对位置的依赖仅体现为相对距 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m-n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65672fb269bbc1640e0d76aab4621b03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yWbZ0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94e49e13" id="u94e49e13">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uccc29b36" id="uccc29b36"><strong><span data-lake-id="u32b03c01" id="u32b03c01">上下文长度插值通常旨在修改式（5）。为统一这些讨论中的表示约定，将修改后的函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f'_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F57375bfc2309b50512f82a6ee28d29d9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XUrcz%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua01c4e0d" id="ua01c4e0d">写为如下形式</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ua5e7c7db" id="ua5e7c7db" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f'_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%2Cm%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D)%3Df_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%2Cg(m)%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bh%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D))%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3aa8fab40e9f0063886a767537bc3f0f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IcDbG%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc7df2c97"><li fid="u5605a305" data-lake-id="uba3dd08e" id="uba3dd08e"><span data-lake-id="uf0c073b6" id="uf0c073b6">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g(m)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F75df890014145fb64fcffc75419faa40.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eOd1W%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u24637072" id="u24637072">是实数之间的映射，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bh%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb03f9c7b8641b32ccb92c1b0bdc8b351.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ECY4J%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u336077c1" id="u336077c1">则依据函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67df0f404d0960fadcc99f6258733f22.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QLgm5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2431c27a" id="u2431c27a">，以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(h(%5C%5Ctheta_1)%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Ch(%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%7CD%7C%2F2%7D))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3afab73a93900499540612b3a243d1d3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TWma2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a91516c" id="u8a91516c">的形式统一作用于对角矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F05ae06f4641ee4065bfb36ccf4786311.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ugdT5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0bda2c2a" id="u0bda2c2a">的各个对角元素</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6516e156" id="u6516e156"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud41996a6" id="ud41996a6">给定预训练阶段的最大上下文长度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Poarf%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2c199693" id="u2c199693">，目标是在进行或不进行微调的情况下，将其扩展为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L'%3EL%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5860c613cc2d05317446f14dad8e5d77.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LDEgB%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5afe7f33" id="u5afe7f33">为此，引入缩放因子</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kfjvO%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u75468798" id="u75468798">，定义为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7BL'%7D%7BL%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd43b9ed4e48f3557d36444f26766f457.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DLzak%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u981df01e"><li fid="u66eb01db" data-lake-id="u5e6cb9e2" id="u5e6cb9e2"><span data-lake-id="u8d8b41c8" id="u8d8b41c8">RoPE 第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KMYzx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua3553af1" id="ua3553af1">个隐藏维度对应的波长</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F07d2cd6880fd265f3c6ad964c5033e7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c80wR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uddf5b341" id="uddf5b341">，定义如下</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u547b3f93" id="u547b3f93" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_d%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B2%5C%5Cpi%7D%7B%5C%5Ctheta_d%7D%3D2%5C%5Cpi%20b%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B2d%7D%7B%7CD%7C%7D%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F42ea011db1524d4bab2f096efc533370.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kKS3k%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u616ec046"><li fid="ucd9784e2" data-lake-id="ubfb3d2fc" id="ubfb3d2fc"><span data-lake-id="ufd13c6fc" id="ufd13c6fc">波长表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IgrpB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u680fb850" id="u680fb850">个维度的旋转位置嵌入完成一次完整旋转所需跨越的词元数量</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="tzcka" id="tzcka" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u14e72dde" id="u14e72dde">🌿 𝐘𝐞𝐭 𝐀𝐧𝐨𝐭𝐡𝐞𝐫 𝐑𝐨𝐏𝐄 𝐄𝐱𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐍 𝐌𝐞𝐭𝐡𝐨𝐝</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5660099c" id="u5660099c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6c262e25" id="u6c262e25">如果仅从信息编码的角度考察旋转位置编码，Tancik et al. 利用神经切线核理论表明：当输入维度较低，且相应嵌入缺少高频分量时，深度神经网络难以学习高频信息</span></strong></p><ul list="ude4e84b2"><li fid="u5c490037" data-lake-id="ua67d4043" id="ua67d4043"><span data-lake-id="ubb20100e" id="ubb20100e">词元的位置信息是一维的，而 RoPE 将其扩展为一个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NaeTW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u48b18e73" id="u48b18e73">维复向量嵌入。RoPE 在许多方面与傅里叶特征十分相似，因为 RoPE 可以被定义为傅里叶特征的一种特殊一维形式</span></li><li fid="u5c490037" data-lake-id="u9a7defeb" id="u9a7defeb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ec73a75" id="u9ec73a75" style="color: #663000">在位置插值中，由于所有维度均按相同的因子</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UfAEB%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u00c88c88" id="u00c88c88" style="color: #663000">进行拉伸，RoPE 的高频分量会被移除。这种退化会随着缩放因子</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T2eet%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u18a9056d" id="u18a9056d" style="color: #663000">的增大而加剧；当缩放达到一定程度时，网络将无法恢复。此前采用 PI 进行微调的工作只能将缩放因子提高至大约</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%3D8%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F36d89a88a2b45d48b6cb00e1a99ef6c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TN9BW%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9d33a702" id="u9d33a702" style="color: #663000">；进一步扩展时，即使经过微调，大语言模型的输出质量也会开始下降</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u81a65754" id="u81a65754"><strong><span data-lake-id="u06807843" id="u06807843">为缓解这一问题，bloc97 提出 NTK-aware 插值。该方法不再以相同因子</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ynkQn%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucfc73a26" id="ucfc73a26">缩放 RoPE 的每个维度，而是对高频采用较小幅度的缩放，对低频采用较大幅度的缩放，从而将插值压力分散到多个维度。实现这种变换有多种方式，其中最简单的方法是调整计算</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RYywq%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud9acdbd6" id="ud9acdbd6">时所使用的底数</span></strong></p><ul list="u7fcb7727"><li fid="u873ec559" data-lake-id="ubd347098" id="ubd347098"><span data-lake-id="u4d49c6ce" id="u4d49c6ce">主要问题是：当希望将上下文窗口扩展至原来的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CPf2b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u47360b6c" id="u47360b6c">倍时，很难确定应采用的最优底数。NTK-aware 插值的最优底数通常需要通过实验确定，这显著增加获得有效微调模型的难度和成本</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uca8a6ab9" id="uca8a6ab9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u723f4e1b" id="u723f4e1b">RoPE 编码的并不只有相对位置：给定上下文长度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S2kU5%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u83b5d4ed" id="u83b5d4ed">，某些维度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wsaSw%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1116a28a" id="u1116a28a">的波长会超过预训练阶段所见的最大上下文长度，即</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%3EL%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdaeff2ed969c0fa68b8a7f63b8c47022.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QXgQo%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u16827be1"><li fid="ubea1297b" data-lake-id="ue16aea53" id="ue16aea53"><span data-lake-id="u7516c1d3" id="u7516c1d3">某些维度的旋转嵌入可能并未均匀分布在整个旋转范围内，也就是说，在完整的训练上下文范围内，这些维度尚未完成一次完整旋转。作者推测，位置对的唯一性意味着这些维度仍然完整保留绝对位置信息。相反，当波长较短时，网络只能从中获取相对位置信息</span></li><li fid="ubea1297b" data-lake-id="ue70b0047" id="ue70b0047"><span data-lake-id="u505b4a77" id="u505b4a77">对于仅编码相对位置信息的维度，保持其不变十分重要，因为这些维度对于网络区分相邻词元的相对顺序至关重要</span></li><li fid="ubea1297b" data-lake-id="ua7031ff3" id="ua7031ff3"><span data-lake-id="u101c0333" id="u101c0333">与此同时，对于仅编码绝对位置信息的维度，则应始终采用插值，因为更大的距离会落在训练分布之外</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua568742d" id="ua568742d"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc396a22e" id="uc396a22e">NTK-aware 插值通过调整底数，实际上实现与上述思路相似的效果；则可以综合这些观察，构造一种明确且具有针对性的插值方法</span></strong></p><ul list="udaca6d0f"><li fid="u6b07e884" data-lake-id="u84f6cd37" id="u84f6cd37"><span data-lake-id="u60d18d12" id="u60d18d12">如果波长 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TeMAq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u22ebdffe" id="u22ebdffe"> 远小于上下文长度 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EmIGQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67230e12" id="u67230e12">，则不进行插值</span></li><li fid="u6b07e884" data-lake-id="u803dbe8b" id="u803dbe8b"><span data-lake-id="ub3bea9c3" id="ub3bea9c3">如果波长 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hhJk1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua35a7c8d" id="ua35a7c8d"> 等于或大于上下文长度 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xPYIP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u56a195b8" id="u56a195b8">，则只进行插值，并避免任何外推；这一点不同于此前的 NTK-aware 方法</span></li><li fid="u6b07e884" data-lake-id="uc3271bc7" id="uc3271bc7"><span data-lake-id="u6ec4ccc3" id="u6ec4ccc3">对于处于两者之间的维度，可以同时包含一定程度的插值与外推，类似于 NTK-aware 插值</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ucca4cc8a" id="ucca4cc8a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u231bb7b9" id="u231bb7b9">引入原始上下文长度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vUHDA%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8fffaa1b" id="u8fffaa1b">与波长</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IjE3g%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8822949e" id="u8822949e">之比</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7BL%7D%7B%5C%5Clambda%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa881a1459436c0b8c956b8d0b39956c4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jDn9I%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua99e886c" id="ua99e886c">会更加方便。该比值表示，在给定的预训练上下文长度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CXkam%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufb3939f2" id="ufb3939f2">内，某个 RoPE 维度完成旋转的次数</span></strong></p><ul list="ud9c9fc13"><li fid="u32b8cc04" data-lake-id="u6785d1a0" id="u6785d1a0"><span data-lake-id="ue999903f" id="ue999903f">对于第 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xPJmp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4f50bc2" id="ud4f50bc2"> 个隐藏维度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LqxuW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uffc1bb93" id="uffc1bb93"> 与 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iHqbO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8f41fa35" id="u8f41fa35"> 的关系为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1a2aa226" id="u1a2aa226" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(d)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7BL%7D%7B%5C%5Clambda_d%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7BL%7D%7B2%5C%5Cpi%20b%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B2d%7D%7B%7CD%7C%7D%7D%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3829ecd2146988e65f08ff754341a835.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VCnCD%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uccca8c3b"><li fid="u0d88ef5f" data-lake-id="ud20e7c75" id="ud20e7c75"><span data-lake-id="u986c21db" id="u986c21db">为界定上述不同插值策略的适用范围，额外引入两个参数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18d25ca4f77a9bbed9812e2bb0b350a5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fg5qc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue4749a1e" id="ue4749a1e"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6100158802e722a88c15efc101fc275b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HlUWy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2527b6d1" id="u2527b6d1">。对于所有满足 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(d)%3C%5C%5Calpha%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd34e99aaeadd7e7759b2562da43f2ae.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NLtTj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u39f21193" id="u39f21193"> 的隐藏维度 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T2pGf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucd99eae5" id="ucd99eae5">，按缩放因子 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qbo2r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7b0fa5eb" id="u7b0fa5eb"> 进行线性插值，与 PI 完全相同，从而避免任何外推；对于满足 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(d)%3E%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0d8d913f019cbfa7f7f4c066d3346ba7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JvVhO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2a568567" id="u2a568567"> 的维度，则完全不进行插值。定义斜坡函数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4aa418d6f0b6fbada90489b4374752e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h9KLp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua4b21eb3" id="ua4b21eb3"> 为：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u31088f28" id="u31088f28" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma(r)%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn0%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%20r%3C%5C%5Calpha%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn1%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%20r%3E%5C%5Cbeta%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cdfrac%7Br-%5C%5Calpha%7D%7B%5C%5Cbeta-%5C%5Calpha%7D%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F104613f967b3de5507195af74d3e3daa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22njAWI%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8460e11f" id="u8460e11f"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf5cb50e8" id="uf5cb50e8">NTK-by-parts 插值是基于式（7）对 RoPE 进行的修改，其中采用以下函数</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uefedfe23" id="uefedfe23" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g(m)%3Dm%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffe205b6219846a1bd976fbcfe7de6320.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pmEzD%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub956c4b9" id="ub956c4b9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h(%5C%5Ctheta_d)%3D%5C%5CBig(1-%5C%5Cgamma%5C%5Cbig(r(d)%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5CBig)%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctheta_d%7D%7Bs%7D%2B%5C%5Cgamma%5C%5Cbig(r(d)%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5Ctheta_d.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc8a8891f526a4a28683309081da6bd7f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yWcMU%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5af10cbe" id="u5af10cbe"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7aa47448" id="u7aa47448">除上述插值技术外，还观察到，在注意力 softmax 之前的 logits 上引入温度 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d5WyN%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u883079ad" id="u883079ad">，会对扩展上下文窗口内的困惑度产生一致的影响，而不依赖于具体的数据样本和词元位置。具体而言，将注意力权重计算修改为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u231efd53" id="u231efd53" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsoftmax%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m%5E%7BT%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n%7D%7Bt%5C%5Csqrt%7B%7CD%7C%7D%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F739f281531dda51c6a2d4a7c6ae12cbe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NC0QP%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufa02344f"><li fid="u607be9fc" data-lake-id="uce09fd45" id="uce09fd45"><span data-lake-id="ue7ec8f76" id="ue7ec8f76">可以采用一种长度缩放技巧，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d911300b5aa9ba64ea87dc37e49c5b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zrvfi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8c09239c" id="u8c09239c">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d7bc143fde06a7a6505ce4e49d940f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xYVAh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u52c7a4ca" id="u52c7a4ca">同时乘以常数因子</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%2Ft%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b0adf5ecbd9be49b4b1097191ac28ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d1nQm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0b82e6ee" id="u0b82e6ee">，而这只需对复数形式的旋转位置嵌入进行相同幅度的缩放即可实现。通过这种方式，YaRN 无需修改注意力机制的代码，就能有效改变其计算行为</span></li><li fid="u607be9fc" data-lake-id="u28b6deed" id="u28b6deed"><span data-lake-id="ueacf4ed5" id="ueacf4ed5">此外，由于旋转位置嵌入会预先生成，并在所有前向传播中复用，因此该方法在推理和训练过程中均不引入额外开销</span></li></ul>